    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SYSTEM TIMETABLE EFFECTIVE MAY 25, 1960\nUNITED\nAIR LINES\nONLY UNITED FLIES THE DOUGLAS\nDC 8\nJET\nCOAST TO COAST... ALONG THE\nCOAST... AND TO HAWAII\nUNITED AIR LINES |\nMU. 2-7300",
      "HONOLULU TIME\nTo ALASKA\n10 50\nибг\nPACIFIC TIME\nTO EDMONT\nSHARY\nMOUNTAIN TIME\nCENTRAL TIME\nEASTERN TIME\nTo the ORIENT\nVANCOUVER, B.\nSEATTLE\nTACOMA\nPORTLAND\nSALEM S\nEUGENES\nMEDFORD\nLLETHBRIDGE\nWINNIPEG\nPRESQUE ISLE\nSPOKANE\nWALLA WAD\nPENDLETON\nREGINA\nPORT ARTHUR\nET. WILLIAM,\nGREAT FALLS\nLEWISTOWN\nBUTTE\nOMILES CITY\nBILLINGS\nWESTOYELLOWSTUKE\nBOISE SUN VALLEY\nSHERIDAN\nPOCATELLO DIACKSON\nCASPER\nCHEYENNE\nMINNEAPOLIS,\n-SAINT PAUL\nELKO\nELY\nTo the ORIENT\nP RAPID CITY\nMILWAUKEE/\nCHICAGO\nHOW CITY\nLINCOLN\nDES MOINES\nMOLINE\nSALT\nDAVENPORT\nROCK ISLAND\nLAKE\nCITY\nGRAND JUNCTION\nASTER\nCOLORADO GON\nPUEBLOR-\nKANSAS CITY O\nSAINT LOUIS\nSHOOVER DAM\nNASHVILLE\n• KAPUSKASING\nCHARLEVIN\nTORONTO\nYOUNG Muall\nCLEVELAND\nFORT\nWAYNE AKRON.CA\nCOLUMBUS\nLOUISVILLE\nKNOXVILLE\nMONTREAL\nBANGOR\n• NORTH BAY\nOTTAWA\n/PORTLAND\nALBANY\nBOSTON S\nTo EUROPE\nHARTFORD\nSPRINGFIEL\nPROVIDENCE\nENTOWN BETHLEHEM-EASTON\nNEW YORK\n*NEWARK\nTo NASSAU,\nPHILADELPHIA\nBERMUDA,\nthe CARIBBEAN,\n•BALTIMORE\nnd AFRICA\nWASHINGTON, D.C.\nHAWAII\nHONOLULU\nTo AUSTRALIA and\nNEW ZEALAND\nRENO\nOAKLAND\nSAN FRANCISCO\nSALINAS •\nMONTEREY-\nCARMEL\nSACRAMENTO\nSTOCKTON\nMODESTO\n* MERCED\nSALIA•\nFRESNO\nLAS VEGAS\n• BAKERSFJELD\nSANTA BARBARA\nHAKKANK\nLOS ANGELES\nLONG BEACH\nSAN DIEGO\nTo MEXICO, CENTRAL\nand SOUTH AMERICA\nNORFOLK\nRALEIGH\nALBUQUERQUE\nTULSA\nAMARILLO\n\\ OKLAHOMA CITY\nPHOENIX\nTUCSON\nDALLAS\nIG SPRING FORT WORTH\nEL PASO\n- MEMPHIS\n/LITTLE ROCK\nSHREVEPORT\nBIRMINGHAM\nUnited Mainliners\nare timed to the\nstars by the Elgin\nNational Watch\nObservatory.\nSAN ANTONIO\nY LAREDO\nKEY\nO BROWNSVILLE\nMOBILE,\nTALLAHA\nSNEW ORLEANS\nTo CENTRAL\nTAMPA\nand SOUTH AMERICA\nUNITED AIR LINES\n-- INTERLINE THROUGH SERVICE\nOTHER AIR LINES\nUACKSONVILLE\nKEY\nWEST\n+ To MEXICO,\nthe CARIBBEAN,\nand SOUTH AMERICA\nDC-8 JETS to still more citles...\nUNITED\nThe only DC-8 Jet to Chicago\nDENVER\nThe only DC-8 Jet to Los Angeles\nThe only through Jet to New York\n*\nDETROIT\nThe only Jet nonstop\nto Los Angeles\nThe only Jet to Philadelphia\n*Starting June 22\nBRITE\nUNITED\nMake a date with the \"8\" on..\nAIR LINES"
